sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as ThreeAxisState
  participant P as Planner
  participant A as Animation
  C->>M: Advance(dt, activity)
  alt 안전/사용자 사건
    C->>A: 행동 중단·물리/입력 반응
    C->>M: Interrupted(reason)
  else 서 있는 idle 허브
    C->>P: Choose(E,C,I, pose, affordance)
    P-->>C: 행동 또는 idle
    C->>A: 시퀀스 시작
    A-->>C: Completed(action, outcome)
    C->>M: Completed(action, outcome)
  end
